 Closing Date, Parent and a rights agent selected by the Company and reasonably acceptable to Parent (the &#8220;Rights Agent&#8221;) will enter into a Contingent Value Rights Agreement, in the form attached as Exhibit A to the Merger Agreement, with such changes as may be permitted by the Merger Agreement (the &#8220;CVR Agreement&#8221;) governing the terms of the CVRs. </p>
